InstrumentFacets.description:
Counts of the active (not retired) instruments per filter value. Sectors are counted over shares only (only shares get one);
sector "Unclassified" = shares without a known sector, and filtering by it returns exactly those. `tracked` = instruments tracked now (what
`?tracked=true` lists, retired ones included); `trackedRetired` = those of them that are no longer in Dhan's list.

RiskProfileView.description:
A shared set of risk limits. Percentages are in percent; "R" values are multiples of the risk per trade. IsSeeded marks a built-in profile
(can be edited, not deleted); AccountCount is how many active accounts use it (a profile in use cannot be deleted);
WeeklyLossAction is "halve_size", "stop_new_entries" or "alert_only".

TrackedInfo.description:
Whether the owner tracks the instrument (every instrument has this block). `active` = tracked now; `since` = when tracking last started;
`deactivatedAt` = when it was switched off (history is kept; null while active); `dataFrom`/`dataTo`/`lastUpdate` = the collected
history (null until the history service has collected some); `backfillRequestedAt` = when collecting history was last asked for;
`retiredButTracked` = tracked, but no longer in Dhan's list (a warning, nothing is removed).
